{"resourceIdentifier":"2525","resourceName":"Ziyang LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Ziyang LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at the Ziyang Municipal Solid Waste Landfill, Wuxian village, Songtao Town, Yanjiang District, Ziyang City, Sichuan province, P.R China. The purpose of the project is to utilize landfill gas (LFG), which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system and electricity generation system. LFG collected will be used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators. The total installed capacity will be 2.134 MW. The project started construction on 08-Apr-2019 and operated on 15-Mar-2020. \r\nIn absence of the project, equivalent amount of electricity exported to the grid by the project would have otherwise been supplied by Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions will be reduced by avoiding CO2 emissions from those fossil fuel-based power plants connected to the grid and by avoiding GHG emissions from releasing LFG into atmosphere at the landfill site.","location":{"latitude":30.098333,"longitude":104.635000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-08-04","endExclusive":"2021-09-04","endInclusive":"2021-09-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2525"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Sichuan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ziyang Oasis Xinzhongshui Environmental Protection Technology Co. Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Sichuan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2525"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"81291"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China Classification Society Certification Company (CCSC)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"29/03/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 15/03/2020 - 14/03/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63943&IDKEY=0903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfs88177397","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"01-Ziyang_VCS-Joint PD and MR_20200315-20210731_V2.0-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-28T19:06:01.567Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=57403&IDKEY=0097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87d79158737","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"05-Ziyang_VCS-Registration-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-11-01T09:24:00.667Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63947&IDKEY=n097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87988182913","documentType":"Validation Report","documentName":"04-Ziyang_VCS-Joint-Validation-Verification report_V2.0-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-28T19:13:39.433Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=57405&IDKEY=lq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhl79161495","documentType":"Validation Representation","documentName":"07-Ziyang_VCS-Validation-Representation-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-11-01T09:25:12.1Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Docum